     "title": "E-Mail Classification System Using Ontology-Base Binary Tree",
     "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.8162647",
     "publication_date": "2023-07-19",
     "description": "<p><em>The internet has changed everyone&rsquo;s lives. It has made accessing, retrieving and exchanging information easy. Email is one such service that has made communication with any person in any part of the world simple and easy. As the number of users is increasing every day, so is the number of emails sent and received. An email inbox contains different emails from important to spam emails. Categorising them manually is a tedious task. This paper will be presenting an approach to classification of mail into different categories using an ontology-based binary search tree.</em></p>",
